Package: openvpn3-gui
Version: 0.4.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mehadi Hasan Shuvo <hasanshuvo.dev@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, python3-cairo, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-vte-2.91, librsvg2-common, openvpn3
Recommends: adwaita-icon-theme
Description: Native GTK desktop companion for OpenVPN 3 Linux
 Manage VPN profiles and sessions with exact D-Bus identifiers.
 Exposes the installed CLI commands and options in graphical forms,
 with a VTE terminal for interactive authentication and live logs.
